| HLT 143 | Medical Terminology | 3 |
| HLT 145 | Ethics for Health Care Personnel | 2 |
| BIO 145 | Basic Human Anatomy & Physiology | 4 |
| | **Total** | 16 |

**Total Minimum Credits: 25**

Notes:

Students should contact Program Chair prior to start of semester. Phlebotomy course (MDL 105) is offered as non-credit and credit.

 1. MDL 196 will be offered only for students who are intending to complete the Phlebotomy Career Studies Certificate. Students must pass a background check and drug screen prior to enrolling in MDL 105 and/or MDL 196.
